{"5012060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caterva: Outsider Dreams", "steam_appid": 5012060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Everyone had the same dream.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Everyone but you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/23f2b82d9c9edbc974a0352fabcfe06a.poster.avif?t=1785888907\" width=1100 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/23f2b82d9c9edbc974a0352fabcfe06a.webm?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/23f2b82d9c9edbc974a0352fabcfe06a.mp4?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>When Milo sleeps, something wakes up in another place.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Walk through a place that shouldn’t exist. The inhabitants who lived here disappeared a long time ago, but their machines are still running and something else was waiting ages to emerge from the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/edf5bef3eff58903ef4ad9120f8aaf01.poster.avif?t=1785888907\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/edf5bef3eff58903ef4ad9120f8aaf01.webm?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/edf5bef3eff58903ef4ad9120f8aaf01.mp4?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change the channel, change the dream.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle between four channels to modify the world around you. Explore a colossal space station lost in time, use antique mechanisms, find secret paths and reconstruct a shattered tale through the traces of a civilization that tried to escape an unavoidable fate. Where every corner could hide a new character, a shortcut, a puzzle or an answer…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/52da9012d6908840873c890df082f6d2.poster.avif?t=1785888907\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/52da9012d6908840873c890df082f6d2.webm?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/52da9012d6908840873c890df082f6d2.mp4?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles blended into the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station was designed to keep functioning for eternity. Comprehend how their machines work is key to open new routes and discover what remains hidden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Combat where knowledge is survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy perceives reality in a different way. During the fights you could change between the four channels in order to disrupt the combat features: invert attacks, boost damage, weaken enemies or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/d940b79f4f762fe36a272045383535b8.poster.avif?t=1785888907\" width=892 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/d940b79f4f762fe36a272045383535b8.webm?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/d940b79f4f762fe36a272045383535b8.mp4?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“She's coming, and the eternal sky will open her womb, spilling children that are not ours. What keeps burning must be smothered. What is still sleeping must be dreaming with her.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/8ac265fe53b01272f04b413dd9a9e9de.poster.avif?t=1785888907\" width=686 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/8ac265fe53b01272f04b413dd9a9e9de.webm?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/8ac265fe53b01272f04b413dd9a9e9de.mp4?t=1785888907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Everyone had the same dream.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Everyone but you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012060/extras/23f2b82d9c9edbc974a0352fabcfe06a.po